{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_intro_title", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_intro_synopsis", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "9dcda2bf00c97821f81aeafcec65662d1e574dda15352bf499361bcd0a2b7a64", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nよかった～、こちらにいらしたんですね♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n太好了～原来你在这里呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "321f175c49c40c0f2a4437ed8d704ce9237e755901588ae27288c4f3730d7eff", "ja": "どうしたんですか、青羽さん。\n俺のこと、探してくれてたみたいですけど。", "zh": "怎么了？青羽小姐。\n看来你是在找我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "73492d588295fccafc1d7c6f980218b4d71ade33c69a08c485f8194028a58540", "ja": "実は、社長さんから{$P$}さんに\n大事なお話があるって、お呼び出しが……。", "zh": "其实是社长说有重要的事\n要找{$P$}先生过去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "063a134a5ce3dcaad140570d2b71b0bb5e5070cf11d5ba4e0ce1b4fc5551feef", "ja": "社長が……？\nわかりました、早速行ってみます！", "zh": "社长他……？\n明白了，我马上过去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "6eb0b148040a8e1a23c3b48ae22d81945fe9b68e5a0243bd94d6778d9c3c2fd6", "ja": "はい、お気をつけて！\n行ってらっしゃ～い♪", "zh": "好的，路上小心！\n请慢走～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_intro_1005_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ee7ae12a5e67326431839ac7d40be348105d85802089039bbfaa3cb026a43ff7", "ja": "失礼します！", "zh": "打扰了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_intro_1007_101kot", "source_sha256": "18400266aa77e031a64efccf972d4e0d57c9ff89e365cdc8929a500bf4b1da44", "ja": "お疲れ様です、{$P$}さん！\nお待ちしてました♪", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生！\n我们正在等你呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d9c2ab39ad6f6003089d2900d028716c1c805799170fd25eb51641991e00028a", "ja": "あ、音無さん、お疲れ様です。\n社長から、何かお話があるって聞きましたけど……。", "zh": "啊，音无小姐，辛苦了。\n听说社长有事找我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_intro_1009_101kot", "source_sha256": "465b6deb5ce6c4e3bad72ae7df80b298a4147e4633b25b1948444ffb59430c3e", "ja": "そうなんです！　なんでも、劇場に新風を巻き起こす\n日が、やって来たとか、来ないとか……！", "zh": "没错！似乎是剧场掀起新潮流的时刻\n到来了，或是没有要来……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4c01e061d3e0113ef7ef64340de66fce779d64527fd183642208b923345fb5c3", "ja": "……やって来たんですね？", "zh": "……应该是到来了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_intro_1011_president", "source_sha256": "ff3ea25b850cb2baa3742aeb417e746e1aeb1f4331cf08670044f14de893e46d", "ja": "いかにも！　相変わらず君は察しがいいね。\nここからは、私が説明しよう。", "zh": "正是如此！你还是一样敏锐呢。\n接下来就由我说明吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "621b642e3501142092941b0fd7ea255ac5678dbff3ce4cf1937958d50a3cd942", "ja": "あ、社長。よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "啊，社长，麻烦您了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "70ecfa607990c3d4d8a8f63b81c5f1c5911ecab1663cd6b0c1e95282e8e1e35d", "ja": "うむ。まず、我が765プロライブ劇場のことだが……\nいや、極めて順調じゃないかね、君！", "zh": "嗯，首先是关于我们765艺能演唱会剧场……\n唉呀，真是顺利到极点了，你说是不是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "5293c24e64cd1590f421a54298378735521e87998a39c87a88a3c1b8b45eb810", "ja": "これも、君の努力と才能のおかげだろう。\nいやはや、実に大したものだ！", "zh": "这也是多亏了你的努力和才能吧，\n唉呀，实在是了不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "8347a120737313efd888504a1e8a1fa064b4864df41679bd50421f16d931f265", "ja": "いえ、アイドル達の頑張りがあってこそです。\nそれで、新風というのは？", "zh": "不，都是因为偶像们非常努力。\n所以，所谓的新潮流是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "1885f4e5b2ac70c8b5c615d80bcc9cdc3077207822a141932dedb99ba2adf6fa", "ja": "うむ。実はね、そんな劇場をより一層盛り上げるために\n……私の方で、ちょっとした企画を用意してみたんだ。", "zh": "嗯，其实呢，为了让剧场更加热闹……\n我试着准备了一点企划。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "cac8a8df2bef1ca8a027517c1e1903fb91ac6cdcf303a6bfc3603d50f6f2b0ae", "ja": "そう、新たにメンバーを選抜して、劇場から発信する\n楽曲をリリースしよう、という企画だよ！", "zh": "没错，这个企划就是选出新的成员，\n推出由剧场发行的歌曲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "863feda04de97a0226aebf8f98d9260fd7fc1fc41e95129711744978d141789f", "ja": "おお、劇場発信の楽曲を……？\nそれは楽しみですね！", "zh": "哦喔，由剧场发行的歌曲……？\n这还真令人期待呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "d10694133d272f0ddf161d15feaa711d6e65efcf06e04d093f721e85f2dcefc2", "ja": "ふふふ、早速、目の色が変わったようだね。\n私の目はごまかせないよ？", "zh": "呵呵呵，看来你的眼神马上就变了呢，\n这可骗不过我的眼睛喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "ff0924a73460a7c6847627db2232e4b512ec84a41e412c08935ad61031a1152a", "ja": "さて、この企画については、歌唱メンバーの選抜から\nすべてを君に任せたいと思っているのだが……。", "zh": "接下来，从选拔歌唱成员开始，\n我打算将这个企划交给你全权处理……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "168c79c19f9ff8e8371914ac536c6d1a5e7b5807ef3689e602442ffad8697aac", "ja": "どうだろう？\nこの企画、引き受けてくれるかね？", "zh": "怎么样？\n你愿意接下这个企划吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_intro_1022", "source_sha256": "9c3e0eab7135bbf0124c363d162784a0708abfe045d94917138ffb36a58b21a3", "ja": "もちろんです！", "zh": "这是当然的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "7433c281795394024c9fbaccce5a0d33bdd5dcec5ea584922070b4e3be706337", "ja": "もちろんです！\n断る理由はありません。楽しい企画になりそうですね！", "zh": "这是当然的！\n我没有理由拒绝，听起来会是个很有趣的企划呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "c694f0cdaeb3cb8dc1137056423ac61f2dc9a5778b082d08df334543ca59d134", "ja": "うむ、君ならそう言ってくれると思っていたよ！\nひとつ、よろしく頼むよ？", "zh": "嗯，我就知道你会这么说！\n这件事就交给你了喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_intro_2002_101kot", "source_sha256": "6a20c9209557d8854f9eec420b8ebd5750bb45b0b639528d47fc885c7f8277a7", "ja": "では、こちらが楽曲のサンプルです。\nとっても可愛い曲ですよ♪", "zh": "那么，这就是歌曲的试听带，\n是一首非常可爱的歌喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_intro_2003_p", "source_sha256": "2b1212c962c9f81c3593566e113e26f745d3567e6b733e20144199e449658b3f", "ja": "へえ、それは楽しみですね。\nありがとうございます！", "zh": "哇，这真令人期待呢，\n谢谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_intro_2004_101kot", "source_sha256": "dd7bb2ad14dfd52a12bfc653f509534d9efc39548128192692fddf6ea856fe47", "ja": "ふふっ、誰がこの曲を歌ってくれるのか……。\n想像するだけで1日楽しめちゃいます♪", "zh": "呵呵，会由谁来唱这首歌呢……\n光是想像都能开心一整天♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_intro_2005_p", "source_sha256": "33903af27d728420d92b6fc78a5f389c3df510018388c88937341e38455388ae", "ja": "そ、そうですか。\nご期待にそえるよう、頑張りますね。", "zh": "是、是这样啊。\n我会努力回应大家的期待喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_intro_2006_p", "source_sha256": "111f90d225cb133dd620867ede9feae5363b271b618e75b62825937bed39a7e1", "ja": "（劇場から発信する楽曲か。\nよし、早速曲を聴いて、歌唱メンバーを選ばないとな）", "zh": "（由剧场发行的歌曲吗……好，\n我得赶紧试听歌曲，选出歌唱成员才行呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_intro_2007_p", "source_sha256": "a9951ce59acb6bf9337b797bde781be95140369f2abe64c3258dc2a565a56593", "ja": "（歌に合う子をしっかり選んで……\nこの企画、絶対に成功させよう！）", "zh": "（好好选出适合这首歌的偶像……\n一定要让这个企划成功！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
